# New Forever dungeon. Source: foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/the-drowned-city (level range is Blizzard's; the page
# says nobody had run it when it was written: the entrance and the quest list come from the game files and explorers).
# No quest ids or giver coordinates are published yet, so this is a note only.
@dungeon The Drowned City
@levels 35-40
@window 35-42
@best 37
@hub Stranglethorn Vale, 27.6, 77.5, 5
@entrance none
RUN @ Stranglethorn Vale, 21, 28 | New Forever dungeon, not checked in game yet. Its entrance is reported under water at about 21, 28 on the Stranglethorn Vale map, in the sea due west of Grom'gol Base Camp. No boat or flight path goes there: fly to Grom'gol and swim. Krazek in Booty Bay (27.0, 77.2) gives Shady Saltseers and The Saltseer Captain. In Grom'gol, Commander Aggro'gosh (32.2, 28.9) gives The Only Good Brinescale... and Kin'weelay (32.3, 27.7) gives The Drowned City. Mazu'kon in Mulgore (32.5, 20.7) gives Ancient Gurubashi Idol. Take what they offer: the addon logs it so these steps can be filled in.
